===Candidates===
*Dan Adamson, businessman and attorney
*Walter Bayes, [[perennial candidate]]
*Jack Alan Johnson
*[[Butch Otter|C.L. "Butch" Otter]], U.S. Representative and former [[Lieutenant Governor of Idaho]]

====Declined====
*[[Jim Risch]], incumbent [[Governor of Idaho]]

